  "person_4": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, this is Josh Whelan, twenty-six, brought in by ambulance after a first fit at home. He's been a bit muddled, but he's coming round."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Jenny. Josh, can you hear me? I'm Dr Park. You're in hospital, you're safe. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. Yeah, I can hear you. What happened? I've got a headache and I feel like I've been hit by a bus."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's what we're here to work out. What's the last thing you remember? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Making toast. Then nothing. Then the ambos were there. I don't even know how I got on the floor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Paramedics say his flatmate saw him shaking all over for about two minutes, went stiff first, and he wasn't responding."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Jenny. Josh, you bit your tongue, I see. Does it hurt?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, it's sore. Tastes like blood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you banged your head, did you fall hard?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I don't think so. I don't remember, but nothing hurts on my head except the headache. No bump that I can feel."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you been unwell lately, any fever, any infection?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. I've been fine. No, I've been fine all week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you take, if anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just my sertraline, 50 mg once a day. For anxiety."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And anxiety is the only condition you've been told about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. Look, can I just go home? I've got work at four. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm afraid not today, Josh. When someone has a first seizure we need to check a few things first. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Doctor, I've got his mum on the phone. She wants to know if she can come in. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes please, Lin, bring her straight through. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll go and meet her at reception. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, Josh's observations. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Blood pressure 128 over 78, pulse 96, temperature 36.9, oxygen 98 percent, respiratory rate 16, and a sugar of 5.4.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Josh, I'm going to check your eyes, your strength, and your balance. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. Whatever. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Follow my finger. Good. Squeeze both my hands. And touch your nose.",
   "pause": 25.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're awake and oriented, you've bitten the side of your tongue, and your strength, reflexes and coordination are all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what was it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't say yet. A first seizure has a number of possible causes, and I don't want to guess. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a CT scan of your head, and the neurology team will see you before you leave."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Do I need a scan? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Even though you seem well, it's standard after a first seizure. Your mum can come with you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. I guess. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Until the neurologists have seen you, you must not drive, and no baths on your own, showers only."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't drive? I need the car for work. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I know it's hard. But until they say otherwise, no driving. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Ugh. ~"
  }
 ],
